      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Hello, doctor. Oh dear, I've got this double vision, since yesterday, and it's the oddest thing. I see two of everything, when I look to the left.",
